    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yes, I'm planning to spend some time in Hawaii. What about you?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T17:23:36.144455+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, you're planning a holiday in Hawaii too? That sounds like a nice vacation! What kind of activities are you looking to do?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T17:24:08.138235+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I'm planning to spend time in Hawaii. What kind of activities do you want to do?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T17:24:47.064795+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, that sounds like a great idea! I'd love to join you.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T17:28:36.758741+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, that's a great idea! I was actually thinking about going on a hiking trip in Hawaii. What do you think?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T17:29:17.217243+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Haha! You're really going to go on a hiking trip in Hawaii?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T17:35:10.899225+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I've always wanted to go hiking in Hawaii. What do you think?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T17:38:28.137574+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I've never been to Hawaii, I really want to experience it!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T17:40:31.896304+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Really? I was planning to just relax and enjoy the sun for a change. What are you into?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T17:46:41.987085+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "What would be a good way to relax and enjoy the sun?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T17:50:54.767231+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "How about going for a hike?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T17:59:58.218281+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Sure thing! Let's go for a hike. What should we do?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T18:00:44.710065+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Alright, I'm up for it! What do you suggest we do when we get there?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T18:05:57.890922+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Ok, let's just head out! What are you into?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T18:24:29.132198+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I'm just really excited to be on vacation in Hawaii! I love hiking and being outdoors. What do you like to do?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T18:27:11.016570+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'd love to join you! I love hiking and being outdoors. What are you into?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T18:28:55.092142+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Haha! I'm really excited to join you!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T18:45:53.547175+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Wow! That's actually the perfect response to my greeting. I love that you're excited for Hawaii!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T18:47:36.307355+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I love going on vacations",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T18:51:16.093456+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh my gosh! I had no idea you loved Hawaii so much!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T18:53:31.257285+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh wow! That's really interesting to me, but I actually always considered Hawaii as my dream vacation. What's a good place for you to go in Hawaii?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T18:55:16.884083+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh wow! I didn't know you liked Hawaii that much. What do you like to do there?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T18:59:31.639851+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, that's really interesting to me. I actually always considered Hawaii as my dream vacation.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T19:02:57.118964+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh wow, you really like that! I've never heard of it before. What are your favorite things to do there?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T19:47:03.472870+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "What are your favorite things to do there? I'm really interested in learning about Hawaiian culture and exploring the beautiful landscapes. What would you recommend for a fun and memorable experience?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T20:09:39.095771+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I really like going for hikes in the mountains. What about you?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T20:15:38.234728+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I love the mountains too",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T20:17:27.654185+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm really glad to hear that you like the mountains too! What are your favorite places to go hiking in Hawaii?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T20:24:10.311719+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Haha! That's really the most exciting thing I've ever heard. My favorite place to go hiking is the Ka\u02bbahu volcano in Hawaii. It has beautiful volcanic views, and it offers a sense of adventure that I love.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T20:26:11.899402+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "That's really the most exciting thing I've ever heard. The Ka\u02bbahu volcano in Hawaii is definitely a must-see for anyone who wants to explore Hawaii or learn more about its culture.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T20:54:18.790584+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "What do you think about my trip? Or, does it sound like an interesting thing to explore more?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T21:01:04.976144+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yes, it sounds like an interesting thing to explore more! Have you seen any interesting places or activities that are unique to Hawaii?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T21:24:48.109484+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "What are some interesting places or activities that you think would be good for me to visit in Hawaii?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T21:33:37.952549+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Do you think it's a good thing to visit Hawaii?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T21:40:47.471483+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, I do, I love Hawaii! It's like a slice of paradise. The beaches are so beautiful and the mountains are just amazing!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T21:42:50.070140+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "from_id": 1,
